sub:assertion {
    <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/claim/morphoeval-delphi10000-ambulocetus-natans-turing-wavelength-s0> pk:hasAssessment <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-ambulocetus-natans-turing-wavelength-s0-overall> .
    <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-ambulocetus-natans-turing-wavelength-s0-overall> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
        rdfs:label "Ambulocetus natans Turing wavenumber at 224 µm (47.5 Ma, detail primordium) — MorphoEval overall 88.9/100" ;
        dct:date "2026-10-27"^^xsd:date ;
        dct:description "Pass 2 sets ANALYSIS_PASS=2. Three seeds give emergent wavelengths 172.8, 175.9 and 177.4 µm (the pass-1 single-seed value was 177.8 µm). Re-running the nonlinear patch at the chronoseries hydrations gives 127.7 µm (Pakicetus, h=0.72), 177.4 µm (Ambulocetus, h=1) and 239.5 µm (Rodhocetus, h=1.35), monotone and in the same order as 190, 224 and 260 µm from lambda = 224 µm * sqrt(h). The fossil mask now keeps the largest Otsu component (foreground fraction 0.178 to 0.161). Dispersion fit is unchanged: Pearson r=0.9997, RMSE=0.0034. The nonlinear peak remains shorter than the analytic fastest mode; that gap is reported. GIF is 12 frames at 720x540. Direct CV similarity of the last frame to the Naturalis photograph is 91.6. Overall 88.9/100 (faithfulness 88.4, reproducibility 90.3); rubric morphoeval 0.1.0; checkpoint commit dff4f2b5; environment: python 3.12, numpy 2.5, scipy 1.18. Dimension assessments: Model fidelity to source 91, Morphological realism / specimen match 84, Parameter expressivity 90, Morphometric validation 91, Source and data traceability 92, Code-to-model traceability 87, Reproducibility package 91. Output judged: docs/media/ambulocetus_natans_turing_wavelength_s0_growth.gif: rendered output of models/2026-delphi10000-ambulocetus-natans-turing-wavelength-s0.py at dff4f2b5, image/gif, 3240023 B, 720×540 px, 12 frames, artifact_sha256 d0ad8d52ca0864aef0caa8c4b9c414223694d9ddb756c1c6966ad822630261d7 (sha256 d0ad8d52ca0864aef0caa8c4b9c414223694d9ddb756c1c6966ad822630261d7), spec_fingerprint 82d5550289ea52c71a2cf9496547413e4cf4267d76c981bb4448f33443a3774d. Dual provenance: spec_fingerprint: 82d5550289ea52c71a2cf9496547413e4cf4267d76c981bb4448f33443a3774d; artifact_sha256: d0ad8d52ca0864aef0caa8c4b9c414223694d9ddb756c1c6966ad822630261d7; input_dataset_sha256: {datasets/ambulocetus_natans_turing_wavelength_s0/ambulocetus_natans_naturalis_specimen.jpg=738e2188c8bb2936..., datasets/ambulocetus_natans_turing_wavelength_s0/ambulocetus_natans_turing_wavelength_s0_reference.json=0246234fefb8db6a...}. Supersedes audit: 2026-10-27-ambulocetus-natans-turing-wavelength-s0-audit. Claim boundary: reported_in_source: Turing 1952: diffusion-driven instability at a finite wavenumber. | Schnakenberg 1979: activator-inhibitor kinetics. | Thewissen, Hussain and Arif 1994: Ambulocetus natans as an amphibious archaeocete. | Thewissen et al. 2001 and Gingerich et al. 1994 place Pakicetus and Rodhocetus on either side of that habit.; reconstructed_in_script: Schnakenberg parameters a=0.05, b=0.90, Du=1, Dv=50, gamma=8, length-scaled to a 224 µm fastest analytic mode. | Multi-seed nonlinear runs and hydration re-runs at h=0.72, 1.0 and 1.35. | Largest-component Otsu mask on the Naturalis photograph.; transfer_boundary: h=0.72 and h=1.35 remain a diffusivity transfer, not a measurement from the fossil papers. | The flank inset is a dermal-field window on a photograph of bone.; does_not_claim: That the skeleton preserves 224 µm pigment stripes. | That the emergent ~177 µm peak equals the analytic 224 µm target.." ;
        dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/morphoeval-rubric-0.1.0> ;
        pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/model/grok-4.7> ;
        pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/overall" ;
        pk:evidenceAgainst "remediation needed: {'id': 'R4', 'item': 'Emergent wavelength stays near 177 µm against the analytic fastest-mode target of 224 µm (ratio about 0.79 at h=1). Reported as a nonlinear shift, not adjusted to force agreement.'}" ;
        pk:hasScore "0.889"^^xsd:double ;
        pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .
    <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/model/grok-4.7> a pk:Model ;
        rdfs:label "Grok 4.7 (builder-assessor, pass 2)" ;
        dct:identifier "grok-4.7" ;
        prov:actedOnBehalfOf <https://orcid.org/0009-0007-4948-9192> .
}

